# =============================================================================
# Project : Project 5 - Java (Spring Boot) App CI/CD on Google GKE
# Author  : Sanjay Naidu
# File    : .dockerignore - keep the build context small and secret-free
# =============================================================================
# Only app/pom.xml and app/src are needed inside the build. Everything else
# stays out: faster uploads to the Docker daemon and no chance of leaking
# local files, CI config or build output into image layers.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
app/target
helm/
scripts/
docs/
README.md
LICENSE
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.trivyignore
*.env
.env
